    description: "FOUND 2026-10-13 by WI-tusad F4 (INV-punig two-parent fixtures), not fixed there (kind classification, not identity).\n\nREPRO: a play whose `tasks:` list is followed by `handlers:` (the gate's ansible fixture, playbooks/site.yml):\n  - name: Web / hosts: web / tasks: [Install (apt), Start (service)] / handlers: [Restart]\n`hypergumbo run --include-docs` emits `Install` and `Start` (tasks) with kind `handler`, beside the real handler `Restart`; a task in a play WITHOUT a following handlers list (the second play's `Install`) is kind `task`.\n\nEXPECTED: tasks under `tasks:` are kind `task` whatever follows them.\nNOT CHECKED: roles/tasks/main.yml files, `pre_tasks` / `post_tasks`, `block:` contents (a block's tasks emit nothing)."  # c639
